  <div class="doc-title">Full Stack Development with MERN</div>
  <div class="doc-subtitle">Project Documentation: IMovies — Movie Ticket Booking System</div>
  <div class="doc-meta">Course Project Documentation | Technology Stack: MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js</div>
