<h2>6. Running the Application</h2>
<h3>6.1 One-Click Launch (Recommended for Windows)</h3>
<p>Simply double-click the <code>start.bat</code> file located in the root project directory. It initializes MongoDB, the Express backend, and the React frontend in separate consoles.</p>

<h3>6.2 Manual Console Startup</h3>
